505
00:25:23.667 --> 00:25:26.717
Piku...whole day she roams around in
the house in just a flimsy night gown...

506
00:25:26.917 --> 00:25:27.842
...that too without a Bra...!

507
00:25:28.042 --> 00:25:29.800
Really Aunty?!
- Maa even you do the same..

508
00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:33.092
Hey...shut up...I Only do
that when I am alone at home...!

509
00:25:33.500 --> 00:25:36.967
Anyways...what's the point in getting
BP checked 100 times in a day...

510
00:25:37.167 --> 00:25:40.342
...whatever this Nobendu came
and said and you started panicking?

511
00:25:40.542 --> 00:25:45.050
...these are all age related
problems...what's so abnormal in it...?

512
00:25:45.250 --> 00:25:46.425
But...what if my BP shoots up?

513
00:25:46.625 --> 00:25:48.842
Everyone has some issue or
the other in their lives...

514
00:25:49.042 --> 00:25:51.550
...just for a day if you haven't crapped,
there isn't any need for this drama!

515
00:25:51.750 --> 00:25:55.592
Nothing has happened to you; you are
just simply going through menopause...

516
00:25:55.792 --> 00:25:57.849
even men go through menopause...

517
00:25:58.292 --> 00:25:59.427
Oh ignore what she's saying...

518
00:26:02.917 --> 00:26:06.842
...no way...here take
a look..he's Asaako...

519
00:26:07.042 --> 00:26:10.217
he cycled even at the age of 99...

520
00:26:10.417 --> 00:26:11.175
died just last week...

521
00:26:11.375 --> 00:26:12.636
how did he die?

522
00:26:13.500 --> 00:26:15.800
Heart attack..cancer..brain damage...?

523
00:26:16.000 --> 00:26:16.717
Nothing's written here...

524
00:26:16.917 --> 00:26:21.727
He who cycles even at the age of 99,
what can he suffer from...?

525
00:26:26.042 --> 00:26:28.395
Hey!
Stop stop Stop---

526
00:26:32.000 --> 00:26:34.137
ls this your cycle...?
- Yes sir

527
00:26:35.417 --> 00:26:36.842
I want to take a small round

528
00:26:37.042 --> 00:26:37.847
sir ..

529
00:26:38.167 --> 00:26:38.925
Sir, I'll be late...

530
00:26:39.125 --> 00:26:40.092
Oh no...!!
- Wait wait wait

531
00:26:40.292 --> 00:26:41.842
be careful

532
00:26:42.042 --> 00:26:43.342
just a few minutes more...

533
00:26:43.542 --> 00:26:44.800
I need to go to other houses too sir

534
00:26:45.000 --> 00:26:47.137
Ya I know...its okay...

535
00:26:47.375 --> 00:26:49.102
Didi will scold...

536
00:26:51.875 --> 00:26:55.138
Don't push...I am trying to balance...
- Careful...

537
00:26:55.875 --> 00:26:58.092
Hey don't push...it'll turn...

538
00:26:58.292 --> 00:27:00.224
Careful...

539
00:27:02.542 --> 00:27:03.598
What...

540
00:27:08.542 --> 00:27:11.350
Sanju is coming to have a talk...

541
00:27:12.375 --> 00:27:15.092
...go change your clothes
or go to the stand...

542
00:27:15.292 --> 00:27:17.144
Why what's wrong with these clothes?

543
00:27:17.542 --> 00:27:19.474
...and in any case he's not
coming to take you back with him..

544
00:27:19.917 --> 00:27:21.342
Look what he's saying mom...

545
00:27:21.542 --> 00:27:23.842
at least we can ask for a settlement?

546
00:27:24.042 --> 00:27:26.967
Well he's already left you
so what are you going to settle?

547
00:27:27.167 --> 00:27:30.510
Now earn...live your
life...respectfully

548
00:27:30.750 --> 00:27:34.967
You're just frustrated and
you don't want even me to be happy...

549
00:27:35.167 --> 00:27:36.300
If you were so worried
about your happiness then..

550
00:27:36.500 --> 00:27:38.217
...why did you steal your mother-in-law's
diamond ring and give it to mom?

551
00:27:38.417 --> 00:27:39.592
It wasn't your
ring...that she stole...

552
00:27:39.792 --> 00:27:41.592
what does he have anyways

553
00:27:41.792 --> 00:27:43.849
Do you even know what honesty means?

554
00:27:44.417 --> 00:27:46.717
...treachery never brings
happiness...do you get that?

555
00:27:46.917 --> 00:27:47.925
As if you've been righteous always...

556
00:27:48.125 --> 00:27:51.718
...exactly...how do we know why
were you thrown out from your job...

557
00:27:52.167 --> 00:27:55.146
Hello..again..where? Honda..

558
00:27:56.542 --> 00:27:57.592
What the taxi's been hit again...

559
00:27:57.792 --> 00:27:59.144
Who was the client?

560
00:28:00.125 --> 00:28:01.467
Tch..Piku..again...

561
00:28:01.667 --> 00:28:04.020
...three drivers have left us already

562
00:28:07.375 --> 00:28:10.763
Hello Syed...look now this
another taxi has also been hit...

563
00:28:11.125 --> 00:28:13.262
...no we need to sort
this out my friend

564
00:28:15.542 --> 00:28:17.519
...ok...I'll see you tomorrow

565
00:28:27.250 --> 00:28:28.717
Played after ages..

566
00:28:28.917 --> 00:28:29.800
Yeah...

567
00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.175
Going back to Saudi...?

568
00:28:31.375 --> 00:28:32.842
Not again..

569
00:28:33.042 --> 00:28:34.967
Aah Piku is here..l
thought you gonna bunk..

570
00:28:35.167 --> 00:28:35.842
It wasn't my fault...

571
00:28:36.042 --> 00:28:38.092
...shall we leave...? - My
driver must've delayed you...isn't it?

572
00:28:38.292 --> 00:28:42.260
You guys chat..I'll just get my Laptop

573
00:28:53.250 --> 00:28:57.264
Well...whatever it may be...these are known
drivers...you're safe with them...

574
00:28:57.667 --> 00:29:00.467
...not only do they listen
to you...they're also scared of you...

575
00:29:00.667 --> 00:29:01.300
Nothing like that...

576
00:29:01.500 --> 00:29:02.467
So what about that Honda case...?

577
00:29:02.667 --> 00:29:05.842
I was getting late for a meeting
so I asked him to speed up...

578
00:29:06.042 --> 00:29:08.342
...normal speeding up...he banged...

579
00:29:08.542 --> 00:29:11.760
this time again you told
him not to stop after banging...

580
00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:13.967
...and even if he did,
Delhi Police listens only to women...

581
00:29:14.167 --> 00:29:15.342
...no matter whoever's
fault it may be...

582
00:29:15.542 --> 00:29:17.217
you mean I am making
them break the rules?

583
00:29:17.417 --> 00:29:19.425
No no I have no problems
with that...break them,

584
00:29:19.625 --> 00:29:21.511
as long as no one gets hurt...

585
00:29:23.375 --> 00:29:25.637
...in any case I send the
damages to your office so it's Ok...

586
00:29:25.875 --> 00:29:31.592
No it's not ok...I can take
an auto...I can manage myself...

587
00:29:31.792 --> 00:29:35.550
...c'mon Piku; he's just saying that he
has some decent drivers working for him..

588
00:29:35.750 --> 00:29:37.102
So it's my fault?

589
00:29:38.917 --> 00:29:42.800
See the point is, everything is mutual...
you don't like them, they don't like you..

590
00:29:43.000 --> 00:29:44.261
Did they say this...?

591
00:29:44.792 --> 00:29:47.145
No, but does it matter...

592
00:29:47.792 --> 00:29:49.769
...when it's the truth..

593
00:29:55.292 --> 00:29:56.723
Got to leave...

594
00:29:57.542 --> 00:29:58.518
okay.

595
00:30:00.792 --> 00:30:03.975
There won't be a
need to take an auto...

596
00:30:07.417 --> 00:30:08.518
See you..

597
00:30:12.042 --> 00:30:13.217
He's rude..

598
00:30:13.417 --> 00:30:14.467
Don't be so judgmental..

599
00:30:14.667 --> 00:30:16.800
Obviously he's your friend
you are going to take his side..

600
00:30:17.000 --> 00:30:18.135
It's not like that..

601
00:30:19.250 --> 00:30:20.135
...sit

602
00:30:24.792 --> 00:30:26.144
You know what

603
00:30:26.917 --> 00:30:27.717
What?

604
00:30:27.917 --> 00:30:29.143
I need a break...

605
00:30:31.250 --> 00:30:33.182
...I won't come to
office for a few days

606
00:30:34.917 --> 00:30:38.510
Piku how am I supposed
to run this firm?

607
00:30:39.042 --> 00:30:40.268
...Piku..listen...

608
00:31:10.500 --> 00:31:12.511
Ae Piku...
- ya..

609
00:31:12.750 --> 00:31:14.477
There is no water in the flush..

610
00:31:16.667 --> 00:31:20.385
Budhan..how many times to tell you
not to put the tea leaves in the basin

611
00:31:28.167 --> 00:31:30.270
I heard you're driver left the job...

612
00:31:30.542 --> 00:31:32.092
...why not keep another...

613
00:31:32.292 --> 00:31:37.228
miser..we're misers...ok?

614
00:31:50.042 --> 00:31:52.300
Hey Piku,
come, the whole gang is here..

615
00:31:52.500 --> 00:31:57.140
No you guys carry on...bye

616
00:31:59.292 --> 00:32:00.393
Hello..

617
00:32:00.917 --> 00:32:02.050
I don't need your taxi

618
00:32:02.250 --> 00:32:03.592
I'll be ashamed if
you're taking an auto...

619
00:32:03.792 --> 00:32:04.967
I said I don't need your taxi.

620
00:32:05.167 --> 00:32:06.925
I'll call you if I need it-
Thank you.

621
00:32:07.125 --> 00:32:09.011
Look we can always sort
out this Driver issue..

622
00:32:13.167 --> 00:32:15.850
...okay...thank you

623
00:32:16.417 --> 00:32:23.139
We've to go for Chhobi's party in the
evening...have you booked the taxi?

624
00:32:36.792 --> 00:32:38.050
Yes.. HIMACHAL TAXI service..

625
00:32:38.250 --> 00:32:40.717
<i>.3124 CR PARK.
8 pm. Sharp.</i>

626
00:32:40.917 --> 00:32:43.600
See I told you you'll need...

627
00:32:55.792 --> 00:32:57.394
Thank you..thank you dear..

628
00:32:57.917 --> 00:32:58.800
Hi..
- Happy Anniversary..

629
00:32:59.000 --> 00:33:00.261
Thank you...

630
00:33:00.875 --> 00:33:03.592
Bhaku da you must have
a drink with me today..

631
00:33:03.792 --> 00:33:05.300
Aunty..he can't have this..

632
00:33:05.500 --> 00:33:06.967
That is why I said no..

633
00:33:07.167 --> 00:33:10.717
It's my anniversary...c'mon..

634
00:33:10.917 --> 00:33:12.894
He can't handle all this..

635
00:33:13.167 --> 00:33:14.675
Then you don't know me!

636
00:33:14.875 --> 00:33:17.967
Ya...that's more like it..cheers

637
00:33:22.042 --> 00:33:24.092
Sou rob Sourob..

638
00:33:24.292 --> 00:33:26.019
Excuse me ladies..

639
00:33:26.250 --> 00:33:27.852
Hi..

640
00:33:28.125 --> 00:33:29.342
You know Bhaskor right..

641
00:33:29.542 --> 00:33:30.467
Ya ya

642
00:33:30.667 --> 00:33:32.717
And she's Bhaskor da's daughter

643
00:33:32.917 --> 00:33:33.925
Hi..
- Hi..

644
00:33:34.125 --> 00:33:34.800
Piku.

645
00:33:35.000 --> 00:33:39.970
Sourab has his own business
in San Francisco and he's single..

646
00:33:40.542 --> 00:33:42.144
You are planning fourth wedding...?

647
00:33:44.542 --> 00:33:46.519
Sunita..hi hi..

648
00:33:48.375 --> 00:33:49.342
So...What do you do?

649
00:33:49.542 --> 00:33:51.467
I have my own art gallery..

650
00:33:51.667 --> 00:33:52.550
Nice..

651
00:33:52.750 --> 00:33:53.800
And you...?

652
00:33:54.000 --> 00:33:55.550
I actually work at
an architecture firm

653
00:33:55.750 --> 00:33:57.477
Do you plan to marry?

654
00:33:59.667 --> 00:34:04.842
lam single...if I find a nice girl,
why not..I mean a nice girl..

655
00:34:05.042 --> 00:34:06.800
But she is very moody.
Like me.

656
00:34:07.000 --> 00:34:09.011
And she's not a virgin...right Piku?

657
00:34:09.292 --> 00:34:13.425
Dad.. - No no no..what
do you mean by 'nice' ?

658
00:34:13.625 --> 00:34:15.217
She has her own business.

659
00:34:15.417 --> 00:34:17.925
She's financially independent...
sexually independent...

660
00:34:18.125 --> 00:34:21.467
...need based...just looking
for emotional partnership..

661
00:34:21.667 --> 00:34:24.717
...so is she 'nice' according to you?

662
00:34:24.917 --> 00:34:26.717
Dad...
- I mean it depends..

663
00:34:26.917 --> 00:34:28.092
Depends on?
- I am leaving...

664
00:34:28.292 --> 00:34:29.092
Where...?

665
00:34:29.292 --> 00:34:30.598
Aunty will drop you home.

666
00:34:32.042 --> 00:34:33.925
Ya so...

667
00:34:34.125 --> 00:34:35.842
what were you saying..

668
00:34:36.042 --> 00:34:37.394
I said it depends...

669
00:35:04.292 --> 00:35:07.384
no..no..let me be...

670
00:35:35.417 --> 00:35:36.973
Dad its late..

671
00:36:22.792 --> 00:36:23.848
Sister...

672
00:36:26.125 --> 00:36:28.967
I tried waking you up at 4 am...

673
00:36:29.167 --> 00:36:33.727
...but you didn't open the
door so I called for Dr. Srivastava...

674
00:36:34.000 --> 00:36:35.092
Nothing to worry...

675
00:36:35.292 --> 00:36:37.925
...a bit of shallow breathing...
pulse drop...that's it...

676
00:36:38.125 --> 00:36:39.967
...Dr Mukherjee has
given him medicines...

677
00:36:40.167 --> 00:36:41.894
right now he's ok..

678
00:36:42.417 --> 00:36:45.020
At his age,
we should not take any risks...

679
00:36:46.417 --> 00:36:48.175
get his tests done...

680
00:36:48.375 --> 00:36:50.261
It's a must..
- Sure.

681
00:37:14.542 --> 00:37:16.092
How are you young man...

682
00:37:16.292 --> 00:37:17.550
...how's everyone at home?

683
00:37:17.750 --> 00:37:20.467
All okay uncle... what happened?

684
00:37:20.667 --> 00:37:24.135
Nothing serious...he just
enjoyed a bit too much...

685
00:37:38.000 --> 00:37:39.761
yeah.. cancel my meetings.

686
00:37:40.917 --> 00:37:44.217
I won't come.
- Budhan, keep the lunch simple today.

687
00:37:44.417 --> 00:37:46.050
...put the pan.

688
00:37:46.250 --> 00:37:47.092
Where...?

689
00:37:47.292 --> 00:37:51.010
On my head...
obviously on the burner...

690
00:38:02.667 --> 00:38:04.519
I'll go to...

691
00:38:06.167 --> 00:38:08.270
I'll go to Kolkata...

692
00:38:08.542 --> 00:38:10.144
PIKU

693
00:38:10.875 --> 00:38:14.718
that idiot Nobendu...

694
00:38:16.042 --> 00:38:18.300
...I won't sell Champa Kunj

695
00:38:18.500 --> 00:38:20.887
How are you?
- o mother...

696
00:38:21.417 --> 00:38:23.645
I will go to Kolkata

697
00:38:43.667 --> 00:38:45.925
No uncle, I am not worried for him...

698
00:38:46.125 --> 00:38:48.050
...in fact it makes
no difference to him...

699
00:38:48.250 --> 00:38:51.050
...if he wants to go he'll go...he
doesn't care about anybody else.

700
00:38:51.250 --> 00:38:55.342
Now do I write on a stamp paper that
I will not die during this trip...

701
00:38:55.542 --> 00:38:57.217
...will that be fine.

702
00:38:57.417 --> 00:38:58.842
Look at his health.

703
00:38:59.042 --> 00:39:03.717
Forget logic...from here to
airport and from there to Kolkata...

704
00:39:03.917 --> 00:39:04.717
It's too much Dada

705
00:39:04.917 --> 00:39:07.217
Flight?
Who said I'll take a flight...?

706
00:39:07.417 --> 00:39:10.467
I'll get palpitations on it...
- Give me some tea

707
00:39:10.667 --> 00:39:12.467
BP fluctuates at that height.

708
00:39:12.667 --> 00:39:17.637
...bathrooms are claustrophobic
palpitation...nervousness.

709
00:39:17.917 --> 00:39:19.467
Its bad for my condition.

710
00:39:19.667 --> 00:39:21.717
I am not going by train certainly.

711
00:39:21.917 --> 00:39:23.143
Train? Never.

712
00:39:23.667 --> 00:39:28.842
Never.. never... this train movement
shakes up everything inside...

713
00:39:29.042 --> 00:39:30.925
I get constipation.

714
00:39:31.125 --> 00:39:32.511
That is not a good option.

715
00:39:32.750 --> 00:39:34.217
Just five days back
you've gotten up from bed.

716
00:39:34.417 --> 00:39:37.342
Could've died...it was
my marriage anniversary...

717
00:39:37.542 --> 00:39:39.592
...why did he have to drink and dance?

718
00:39:39.792 --> 00:39:43.592
And then he comes home...drinks...
Budhan why did you give him the drink?

719
00:39:43.792 --> 00:39:45.592
Piku you also didn't bother.

720
00:39:45.792 --> 00:39:47.092
This old man has gone senile!

721
00:39:47.292 --> 00:39:49.467
Look you don't interfere.

722
00:39:49.667 --> 00:39:50.592
No one is asking you.

723
00:39:50.792 --> 00:39:53.967
You're my sister's husband
that's why I am concerned...

724
00:39:54.167 --> 00:39:56.850
But your sister is no more..
so keep quiet.

725
00:39:57.125 --> 00:39:58.467
Hey shrivastava.

726
00:39:58.667 --> 00:40:00.592
There is one way.

727
00:40:00.792 --> 00:40:01.800
I've an idea.

728
00:40:02.000 --> 00:40:04.050
I was thinking exactly the same...

729
00:40:04.250 --> 00:40:10.842
...you might get tired but
then you can stop anywhere and walk...

730
00:40:11.042 --> 00:40:13.092
Correct..correct..correct.

731
00:40:13.292 --> 00:40:15.599
That way things will be in control.

732
00:40:16.292 --> 00:40:18.217
According to my convenience.

733
00:40:18.417 --> 00:40:19.842
<i>Yes</i>

734
00:40:20.042 --> 00:40:20.973
As in?

735
00:40:21.625 --> 00:40:25.844
As in nothing...done...decided!

736
00:40:31.542 --> 00:40:34.092
Who'll drive that madam
from CR park to Kolkata?

737
00:40:34.292 --> 00:40:36.395
Day after morning at 4.30 am...
who's duty is it?

738
00:40:39.542 --> 00:40:40.925
Come on she's not bad at heart.

739
00:40:41.125 --> 00:40:43.762
Alright then Dhani Raam.. take
the car that has a carrier on top.

740
00:40:48.042 --> 00:40:49.268
Here...take this.

741
00:40:50.292 --> 00:40:51.348
Here...

742
00:40:51.750 --> 00:40:55.389
take out the other two
suitcases kept in the garage

743
00:41:01.250 --> 00:41:02.511
Budhan

744
00:41:03.667 --> 00:41:06.395
All this will not
fit in one suitcase...

745
00:41:07.417 --> 00:41:08.894
...need another one

746
00:41:22.917 --> 00:41:24.519
He should be here any moment

747
00:41:40.625 --> 00:41:41.592
Where's your Driver?

748
00:41:41.792 --> 00:41:43.675
Am sure he must be on his way...

749
00:41:43.875 --> 00:41:45.175
...or may have stopped
for some fuel perhaps.

750
00:41:45.375 --> 00:41:47.512
I've been calling you since 4 am!

751
00:41:47.792 --> 00:41:49.394
I'll check

752
00:42:17.167 --> 00:42:20.175
Hello. - I told you my father will
be travelling too...he's an old man.

753
00:42:20.375 --> 00:42:22.092
Let me talk to him...and I am not old!
- dad.

754
00:42:22.292 --> 00:42:23.800
Sorry Piku.. I can't get
through any driver just now...so.

755
00:42:24.000 --> 00:42:25.842
We've been waiting for over two hours
now...with our luggage all packed...

756
00:42:26.042 --> 00:42:27.217
...and you are telling
me there is no driver.

757
00:42:27.417 --> 00:42:29.842
Look look..I am trying...
just give me some time.

758
00:42:30.042 --> 00:42:32.717
If you don't know how to do business
then why did you even take the booking?

759
