1009
00:57:44.792 --> 00:57:46.342
sir...I don't even know how
to use it ...i am telling you...

1010
00:57:46.542 --> 00:57:47.717
No no no!
I won't travel with you

1011
00:57:47.917 --> 00:57:49.092
What...?

1012
00:57:49.292 --> 00:57:51.092
No no... I can't trust somebody...

1013
00:57:51.292 --> 00:57:53.842
.-.who has a knife--.! - Dad.- don't
create fuss in middle of the road..

1014
00:57:54.042 --> 00:57:55.842
Please uncle trust me ..trust me...
- I am not your uncle..

1015
00:57:56.042 --> 00:57:57.092
lam not your uncle..

1016
00:57:57.292 --> 00:57:59.842
...I'll just not go...you
first throw this knife...

1017
00:58:00.042 --> 00:58:01.842
otherwise I am not going..
- How can I throw it...

1018
00:58:02.042 --> 00:58:03.800
No you throw it--.take
it in your hand and throw

1019
00:58:04.000 --> 00:58:05.217
I can't...it was kept in the car

1020
00:58:05.417 --> 00:58:06.717
So you agree it was kept in the car...

1021
00:58:06.917 --> 00:58:09.592
...I had told you I don't
want to travel with a liar...

1022
00:58:09.792 --> 00:58:10.967
lam not a liar...
- You are a liar..

1023
00:58:11.167 --> 00:58:12.967
lam not a liar...I can't throw it...
- You are a liar..

1024
00:58:13.167 --> 00:58:15.592
Whole journey is left ...there is
a girl with us...how can I throw it?

1025
00:58:15.792 --> 00:58:17.092
Girl?..she's my daughter...

1026
00:58:17.292 --> 00:58:19.092
fine.. but how can I throw it?
she's also my responsibility...

1027
00:58:19.292 --> 00:58:21.092
No you have to
- I won't

1028
00:58:21.292 --> 00:58:22.592
You will...otherwise I am not going

1029
00:58:22.792 --> 00:58:23.552
Keep screaming..

1030
00:58:27.417 --> 00:58:28.217
Ok...!

1031
00:58:28.417 --> 00:58:29.175
Now sit inside...

1032
00:58:29.375 --> 00:58:31.478
what..no you tell him
to pick this up and throw..

1033
00:58:34.250 --> 00:58:36.637
...throw it otherwise
I am not going...

1034
00:58:37.292 --> 00:58:38.974
I am not throwing it...

1035
00:59:20.625 --> 00:59:21.726
What happened?

1036
00:59:22.500 --> 00:59:24.477
Did the tyre get punctured?

1037
00:59:27.417 --> 00:59:28.643
Why don't you throw it?

1038
01:00:00.750 --> 01:00:05.265
There's nothing else here...relax...

1039
01:00:34.500 --> 01:00:37.012
So you must be having another
source of income as well...

1040
01:00:40.625 --> 01:00:41.886
sorry...?

1041
01:00:42.167 --> 01:00:42.925
Another source of income...?

1042
01:00:43.125 --> 01:00:43.675
None.

1043
01:00:43.875 --> 01:00:44.592
Are you sure?

1044
01:00:44.792 --> 01:00:45.643
Dad..

1045
01:00:47.792 --> 01:00:49.967
Since when are you
running this taxi business?

1046
01:00:50.167 --> 01:00:52.342
It was my father's
business actually...so I...

1047
01:00:52.542 --> 01:00:56.385
oh the greed to earn more money...

1048
01:00:56.792 --> 01:00:58.269
I had a job earlier...

1049
01:00:58.500 --> 01:00:59.601
Where?

1050
01:01:00.250 --> 01:01:02.637
Saudi...civil construction.

1051
01:01:03.167 --> 01:01:07.101
Is this what an Engineer does to
earn a living? A taxi business? Sad..

1052
01:01:08.000 --> 01:01:12.515
They'd promised a big position
at the time of the interview...

1053
01:01:12.917 --> 01:01:14.717
but once I got there...l
realized I was duped...

1054
01:01:14.917 --> 01:01:16.473
Why didn't you come back?

1055
01:01:17.375 --> 01:01:19.175
My passport was them
with a contract of two years!

1056
01:01:19.375 --> 01:01:20.550
God! but who gives the passport

1057
01:01:20.750 --> 01:01:23.175
That's the way it is...

1058
01:01:23.375 --> 01:01:24.342
So then...?

1059
01:01:24.542 --> 01:01:28.342
I had a tiff with my supervisor,
even though I was right...

1060
01:01:28.542 --> 01:01:29.848
I lost my job...

1061
01:01:30.167 --> 01:01:33.467
Hey Piku...your 'Paanchu
babu...!' (cry baby)

1062
01:01:33.667 --> 01:01:35.474
What's that?

1063
01:01:38.667 --> 01:01:39.893
Nothing...

1064
01:01:41.542 --> 01:01:46.478
...I mean if you know you were
right then why that sullen face...?

1065
01:01:47.000 --> 01:01:49.307
All honest men in the world
have faced similar consequences...

1066
01:01:52.875 --> 01:01:59.972
...well neither will you gain
my sympathy nor try to gain Piku's...

1067
01:02:03.917 --> 01:02:06.975
so you came back...?

1068
01:02:08.875 --> 01:02:12.013
Ya...and handling this
taxi business since then...

1069
01:02:25.292 --> 01:02:28.760
yes Srivastav..she's checking...

1070
01:02:30.625 --> 01:02:31.842
130/90

1071
01:02:32.042 --> 01:02:34.224
yes 130!90..

1072
01:02:34.667 --> 01:02:37.759
...yes I have Crateagus...fine then...

1073
01:02:38.167 --> 01:02:40.599
...hey Budhan get me Crateagus..

1074
01:02:42.792 --> 01:02:44.717
Taansen sang 'Raaga Deepak'...

1075
01:02:44.917 --> 01:02:46.769
...all the lamps lit up...

1076
01:02:47.750 --> 01:02:50.050
...he sang 'Raga Malhaar'..

1077
01:02:50.250 --> 01:02:51.592
...well it rained...

1078
01:02:51.792 --> 01:02:59.390
<i>so</i> why didn't anyone sing 'Raga Motion'...
you would've been relieved by now...

1079
01:03:00.542 --> 01:03:02.895
Like Raga motion

1080
01:03:03.875 --> 01:03:05.101
What do you say?

1081
01:03:05.917 --> 01:03:08.800
Here's what I have...Indian
Basil and mint leaves..

1082
01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:12.013
...boil them in water
and drink it...you'll be fine...

1083
01:03:12.250 --> 01:03:13.217
How do you know ...?

1084
01:03:13.417 --> 01:03:14.217
Will you boil these
or should I throw them...?

1085
01:03:14.417 --> 01:03:18.852
No wait...Budhan...get
this done for me...

1086
01:03:19.167 --> 01:03:22.385
Trust me...whatever is inside,
it'll come out...

1087
01:03:22.750 --> 01:03:24.636
Okay... fine

1088
01:03:31.625 --> 01:03:37.516
Tell me one thing...is this the only topic
that you both discuss...the whole day?

1089
01:03:38.250 --> 01:03:39.385
Yeah..

1090
01:03:43.417 --> 01:03:46.270
I should've found out before
taking the booking...well...

1091
01:04:18.542 --> 01:04:22.351
Prayers to the God
at 5am and check out at 8..

1092
01:04:23.042 --> 01:04:24.925
Lakhan take them
to room number 112

1093
01:04:25.125 --> 01:04:27.467
Budhan keep the medicines ready...

1094
01:04:27.667 --> 01:04:29.269
...I'll see you in a bit Dad..

1095
01:04:29.542 --> 01:04:30.723
Piku...where...?

1096
01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:32.101
I'm coming...

1097
01:04:54.042 --> 01:04:57.021
This place is famous
for its desserts...

1098
01:04:58.000 --> 01:04:59.511
...would you like to have some?

1099
01:05:01.542 --> 01:05:02.894
Am I disturbing you...?

1100
01:05:04.917 --> 01:05:06.592
Can we sit quietly please...?

1101
01:05:06.792 --> 01:05:08.098
Ya sure..

1102
01:05:15.250 --> 01:05:17.136
You were calling someone scheming...?

1103
01:05:17.792 --> 01:05:18.973
Not you..

1104
01:05:19.417 --> 01:05:21.144
Better not!

1105
01:05:21.917 --> 01:05:23.894
I would've thrown
you out of the car..

1106
01:05:26.167 --> 01:05:27.644
How would your Dad have
gone to Kolkata then?

1107
01:05:28.125 --> 01:05:29.592
I would've driven...

1108
01:05:29.792 --> 01:05:32.884
really?...
well...had I known this earlier,

1109
01:05:33.292 --> 01:05:35.474
I could've stretched for a bit...

1110
01:05:38.500 --> 01:05:39.886
...now you drive tomorrow...

1111
01:05:41.042 --> 01:05:42.217
I don't like driving...

1112
01:05:42.417 --> 01:05:46.800
why...? as in? women in
Saudi are fighting with the govt.

1113
01:05:47.000 --> 01:05:50.013
For their driving rights...
getting jailed too for same...

1114
01:05:50.250 --> 01:05:51.925
...and you say you don't
like driving...that's weird..

1115
01:05:52.125 --> 01:05:54.057
Not really-..those
countries are like that...

1116
01:05:57.042 --> 01:06:00.260
...moreover...driving
liberates a woman...

1117
01:06:05.542 --> 01:06:09.761
Are you saying all this to impress
me or you really do respect women?

1118
01:06:10.292 --> 01:06:12.645
Isn't it written on my face?

1119
01:06:14.375 --> 01:06:22.348
Well...You were arguing
with some Ritu this morning...

1120
01:06:24.000 --> 01:06:25.261
My sister..

1121
01:06:25.667 --> 01:06:28.270
And my mother,
another devious woman...

1122
01:06:29.000 --> 01:06:32.968
...I swear...you can ask Syed...

1123
01:06:33.917 --> 01:06:37.885
Yes Dad..ok I'll be there

1124
01:06:40.042 --> 01:06:45.842
tell me something...you're
really his daughter...

1125
01:06:46.042 --> 01:06:46.893
...I mean...

1126
01:06:47.542 --> 01:06:48.848
yes...I am 'his' daughter

1127
01:06:49.292 --> 01:06:53.342
...and ten times more strange..
weird..irritating..annoying

1128
01:06:53.542 --> 01:06:55.300
No no no ...I didn't
mean that way...

1129
01:06:55.500 --> 01:06:58.012
No I know what you mean...l
know its weird its okay...

1130
01:06:59.417 --> 01:07:02.509
...but I am like that...

1131
01:07:09.042 --> 01:07:10.675
<i>Hello..hello</i>

1132
01:07:10.875 --> 01:07:12.511
There's no room that's vacant

1133
01:07:12.917 --> 01:07:14.894
Excuse me...room...I need a room...

1134
01:07:15.417 --> 01:07:16.050
all occupied

1135
01:07:16.250 --> 01:07:18.592
that Bengali family that's just walked in
...I am part of that...excuse me...

1136
01:07:18.792 --> 01:07:20.769
Not here...go...

1137
01:07:25.500 --> 01:07:27.011
Which room number is
that Bengali family in...?

1138
01:07:31.792 --> 01:07:33.394
Piku..

1139
01:07:35.542 --> 01:07:37.925
There aren't any rooms available
...apparently a lot of tourist..

1140
01:07:38.125 --> 01:07:39.467
I know.. Budhan is
also sleeping in the car..

1141
01:07:39.667 --> 01:07:43.635
Hey listen I am the owner...not your
driver that I go and sleep next to him

1142
01:07:43.875 --> 01:07:45.092
That dormitory is
infested with mosquitoes...

1143
01:07:45.292 --> 01:07:48.145
Its midnight
already...just go please...

1144
01:07:48.667 --> 01:07:52.592
I am not sleeping outside..

1145
01:07:52.792 --> 01:07:54.342
Is this the only hotel in Banaras...?

1146
01:07:54.542 --> 01:07:57.270
Piku..

1147
01:08:01.917 --> 01:08:05.760
You're behaving as if I am
barging in your personal bedroom...

1148
01:08:08.417 --> 01:08:09.973
...fine...

1149
01:08:10.292 --> 01:08:15.467
...I'll leave but this
is not...I am taking the car...

1150
01:08:15.667 --> 01:08:17.467
...your luggage is there...and
your father's throne as well...

1151
01:08:17.667 --> 01:08:19.019
...ok tata bye bye..

1152
01:08:19.917 --> 01:08:21.644
What time will you
be here in the morning...?

1153
01:08:22.625 --> 01:08:25.763
Have no idea...not sure
if I'll come at all...

1154
01:08:31.542 --> 01:08:33.098
listen

1155
01:08:39.750 --> 01:08:40.726
Say...

1156
01:08:42.000 --> 01:08:43.477
...sleep here..

1157
01:08:44.667 --> 01:08:46.724
See that's what I was saying..

1158
01:08:48.917 --> 01:08:50.894
But on a chair...?

1159
01:08:59.667 --> 01:09:01.895
Shhh! Now what is it?

1160
01:09:02.500 --> 01:09:03.425
Switch off the light

1161
01:09:03.625 --> 01:09:05.227
Can I change?

1162
01:09:06.042 --> 01:09:07.217
Can you not make any sound...

1163
01:09:07.417 --> 01:09:08.643
right..

1164
01:09:21.625 --> 01:09:23.978
That basil water did nothing...

1165
01:09:25.000 --> 01:09:28.013
Sir do you sit Indian
style or western style...?

1166
01:09:31.042 --> 01:09:35.467
Do you sit Indian
style or western...?

1167
01:09:35.667 --> 01:09:36.425
Huh? What do you mean?

1168
01:09:36.625 --> 01:09:38.636
There aren't any toilets
with Indian style these days..

1169
01:09:39.167 --> 01:09:41.019
That's the issue...

1170
01:09:41.292 --> 01:09:45.717
...it's the most scientific
way for excretion...

1171
01:09:45.917 --> 01:09:48.467
...Rana..please..stop
this nonsense discussion..

1172
01:09:48.667 --> 01:09:49.675
No no its not Nonsense..

1173
01:09:49.875 --> 01:09:54.467
...did our fore fathers ever
have this constipation problem...

1174
01:09:54.667 --> 01:09:57.592
just try and remember...no...
never...isn't it...?

1175
01:09:57.792 --> 01:09:58.717
Naa..I didn't get you...

1176
01:09:58.917 --> 01:10:03.050
This constipation problem wasn't
there in olden days...isn't it?

1177
01:10:03.250 --> 01:10:04.217
Right..

1178
01:10:04.417 --> 01:10:06.849
Sir let me explain you,
it's a very simple formula...!

1179
01:10:07.500 --> 01:10:08.217
Now this is our stomach..

1180
01:10:08.417 --> 01:10:08.842
Ya..

1181
01:10:09.042 --> 01:10:12.760
...our intestines
go like this...see...

1182
01:10:13.500 --> 01:10:16.467
...this is our stomach...this
turns here...

1183
01:10:16.667 --> 01:10:19.145
...and after that...makes
this question mark kind of thing...

1184
01:10:19.375 --> 01:10:24.390
...and when we...one minute...

1185
01:10:25.667 --> 01:10:30.261
...sit like this...it
puts pressure on our stomach...

1186
01:10:31.375 --> 01:10:32.800
...and intestines get pressed...

1187
01:10:33.000 --> 01:10:39.972
...and whatever waste material is there
in the pipeline that slowly comes out".

1188
01:10:42.792 --> 01:10:44.644
...no need to put pressure...it
happens on its own...

1189
01:10:45.042 --> 01:10:45.768
are you a doctor?

1190
01:10:46.167 --> 01:10:47.592
And aren't we getting late now?

1191
01:10:47.792 --> 01:10:49.175
Can't leave him like this...can we?

1192
01:10:49.375 --> 01:10:50.727
Sir...should we try again?

1193
01:10:51.292 --> 01:10:54.092
Where...here? What if I fall down?

1194
01:10:54.292 --> 01:10:55.467
I want to reach Kolkata safely..

1195
01:10:55.667 --> 01:10:58.217
Dad has arthritis...he
cannot do this stunts..

1196
01:10:58.417 --> 01:11:00.269
Budhan will help

1197
01:11:01.000 --> 01:11:02.217
I can also...come inside

1198
01:11:02.417 --> 01:11:02.967
Na..na..I will try..

1199
01:11:03.167 --> 01:11:06.050
Dad..what's wrong with you?
You cannot..climb this...!

1200
01:11:06.250 --> 01:11:10.217
This is western style,
how will I squat on it...?

1201
01:11:10.417 --> 01:11:11.342
Let me help you...

1202
01:11:11.542 --> 01:11:12.592
Dad what if you fall...?

1203
01:11:12.792 --> 01:11:14.800
Wait...wait...hey Budhan..

1204
01:11:15.000 --> 01:11:16.467
Yes..
- Come here...

1205
01:11:16.667 --> 01:11:19.550
Fine...when you're done
with this circus...call me...

1206
01:11:19.750 --> 01:11:20.425
Sir let her go...

1207
01:11:20.625 --> 01:11:21.550
We will try

1208
01:11:21.750 --> 01:11:23.352
Please hold my hands

1209
01:11:28.000 --> 01:11:31.263
Hey go away you both...l
need to take off my night pants...

1210
01:11:31.500 --> 01:11:32.092
Should I also...?

1211
01:11:32.292 --> 01:11:33.393
Yes...go...

1212
01:11:33.667 --> 01:11:34.842
Will you manage to...

1213
01:11:35.042 --> 01:11:35.643
Absolutely

1214
01:11:40.167 --> 01:11:41.217
Done?

1215
01:11:41.417 --> 01:11:46.478
...not satisfactorily...but
at least got something new to try..

1216
01:11:53.292 --> 01:11:57.101
Don't think you can impress
him or me with your home remedies...

1217
01:12:00.375 --> 01:12:02.175
...we know everything
about constipation..

1218
01:12:02.375 --> 01:12:03.476
Ohh yeah obviously...

1219
01:12:09.792 --> 01:12:14.261
Grand Pa's been lying still for a while...

1220
01:12:14.792 --> 01:12:15.893
Should I check him?

1221
01:12:16.250 --> 01:12:18.637
Keep quiet! He's resting...

1222
01:12:19.125 --> 01:12:20.800
There's no better place
then Banaras for last rites...

1223
01:12:21.000 --> 01:12:22.217
Shut up.

1224
01:12:22.417 --> 01:12:24.895
Just check on him...we
can still get back to Banaras

1225
01:12:33.542 --> 01:12:37.092
Hey..why are you...?
And why are you speeding...?

1226
01:12:37.292 --> 01:12:38.092
I am not..

1227
01:12:38.292 --> 01:12:40.175
Look in front...look
in front...oh god...

1228
01:12:40.375 --> 01:12:42.967
Relax and sing that
path song you sang earlier...

1229
01:12:43.167 --> 01:12:43.800
you should be there

1230
01:12:44.000 --> 01:12:47.717
...let him drive...we're
paying you to drive not sit...

1231
01:12:47.917 --> 01:12:48.800
She's driving fine...

1232
01:12:49.000 --> 01:12:49.800
I know how to drive...

1233
01:12:50.000 --> 01:12:52.175
Piku you've never
driven on a highway...

1234
01:12:52.375 --> 01:12:53.675
This is how accidents
happen Dad... Keep..

1235
01:12:53.875 --> 01:12:54.217
Keep quiet...

1236
01:12:54.417 --> 01:12:55.592
But what if she bangs...

1237
01:12:55.792 --> 01:12:59.092
I don't want to come under
a truck like a dog or a cat..

1238
01:12:59.292 --> 01:13:00.842
...I don't like unnatural deaths..

1239
01:13:01.042 --> 01:13:03.975
Stop stop stop the car..

1240
01:13:04.542 --> 01:13:06.599
Slow..slow..

1241
01:13:09.792 --> 01:13:10.643
Hey“

1242
01:13:15.250 --> 01:13:17.261
It doesn't matter what
you like or what you don't...

1243
01:13:17.542 --> 01:13:19.050
...whenever its time...you'll die...

1244
01:13:19.250 --> 01:13:21.353
...on a road...in a hospital...

1245
01:13:23.667 --> 01:13:27.967
...death and shit... come
unannounced...anytime... anywhere...

1246
01:13:28.167 --> 01:13:29.644
I disagree!

1247
01:13:30.125 --> 01:13:31.135
Gem...

1248
01:13:44.292 --> 01:13:51.139
Do you know patience
is a must for a good driver...

1249
01:13:51.500 --> 01:13:52.635
...I was testing..

1250
01:13:53.000 --> 01:13:56.889
...that's all...come...come..

1251
01:13:59.542 --> 01:14:00.768
Lets go..

1252
01:14:18.500 --> 01:14:20.261
Who all stay in Kolkata...?

1253
01:14:21.292 --> 01:14:22.974
Uncle...aunt...

1254
01:14:25.792 --> 01:14:28.645
...actually my mother, dad and I...
we used to stay there earlier

1255
01:14:29.042 --> 01:14:31.770
In any case one leg of
Bengalis is always in Kolkata...

1256
01:14:32.042 --> 01:14:36.842
...yeah but I mean...I feel
totally at home in Delhi also...

1257
01:14:37.042 --> 01:14:40.467
Ya but one does have connections
with the place one belongs to...

1258
01:14:40.667 --> 01:14:42.092
Correct...Correct

1259
01:14:42.292 --> 01:14:43.925
But there is nothing for me Baba...

1260
01:14:44.125 --> 01:14:47.342
...few relatives...I have no connection
with them...and that house

1261
01:14:47.542 --> 01:14:50.634
Which you want to sell off
but I won't let you...

1262
01:14:50.875 --> 01:14:52.852
Are you going to
sell off your home ...?

1263
01:14:55.625 --> 01:14:57.011
Don't know...

1264
01:15:37.250 --> 01:15:41.092
Hey Budhan...where
did it's cell go...?

1265
01:15:41.292 --> 01:15:41.967
Cell...

1266
01:15:42.167 --> 01:15:43.467
I gave it to you...

1267
01:15:43.667 --> 01:15:47.010
No, it was in your hand when we stopped
at that roadside place for dinner...

1268
01:15:47.417 --> 01:15:48.427
ls it...?

1269
01:15:50.250 --> 01:15:51.977
Turn back the car...turn back...

1270
01:15:52.542 --> 01:15:53.473
What...?

1271
01:15:53.917 --> 01:15:55.092
Turn back the car...

1272
01:15:55.292 --> 01:15:55.967
What...?

1273
01:15:56.167 --> 01:15:58.800
My ear plug cell has gone weak...

1274
01:15:59.000 --> 01:15:59.967
...I think I've left it
behind where we'd stopped...

1275
01:16:00.167 --> 01:16:02.342
...hey why are you still
driving ...u turn u turn...

1276
01:16:02.542 --> 01:16:04.467
We'll be in Kolkata in a bit...

1277
01:16:04.667 --> 01:16:06.717
Nobody is talking to you mister...

1278
01:16:06.917 --> 01:16:08.300
...do <i>as</i> I say ...u turn...

1279
01:16:08.500 --> 01:16:10.967
Dad...I am sure you have enough
battery that can last you till there...

1280
01:16:11.167 --> 01:16:12.428
...we can't <i>waste</i>
time unnecessarily

1281
01:16:14.000 --> 01:16:15.386
Oh Unnecessary...

1282
01:16:16.042 --> 01:16:19.717
...this ear whistles
due to weak battery...

1283
01:16:19.917 --> 01:16:21.675
...strange sounds
come out of here...

1284
01:16:21.875 --> 01:16:23.352
...is it unnecessary?

1285
01:16:24.792 --> 01:16:27.967
Why do you think
lam a burden on you...

1286
01:16:28.167 --> 01:16:28.842
lam not a burden...!

1287
01:16:29.042 --> 01:16:31.592
Look...I can do everything
on my own...alright...?

1288
01:16:31.792 --> 01:16:32.592
Oh...Dad...please...you...

1289
01:16:32.792 --> 01:16:35.270
Na Na...you be quiet...!

1290
01:16:35.917 --> 01:16:38.967
And you ...you are charging us...

1291
01:16:39.167 --> 01:16:41.092
...if you don't listen to me...

1292
01:16:41.292 --> 01:16:43.092
...I won't care whether
you're an owner or a driver...

1293
01:16:43.292 --> 01:16:44.644
...I can take bus also...

1294
01:16:45.917 --> 01:16:49.851
I am fit...I am not dependent
on any body ...no body...

1295
01:16:50.917 --> 01:16:52.769
Unnecessary!

1296
01:16:53.417 --> 01:16:54.894
Why have you stopped here...?

1297
01:16:55.292 --> 01:16:56.842
Fine...you can take the bus...

1298
01:16:57.042 --> 01:16:59.217
...stopping every now and then...bloody...
even my patience is running out...

1299
01:16:59.417 --> 01:17:00.092
Please mind your language...

1300
01:17:00.292 --> 01:17:01.550
No I have not said anything wrong...

1301
01:17:01.750 --> 01:17:03.511
...and what's with
this burden thing...?

1302
01:17:03.792 --> 01:17:06.884
Wonder why parents feel satisfied in
emotionally blackmailing their kids...

1303
01:17:07.500 --> 01:17:10.342
...if you were a burden ...you
would've been sitting in Delhi..

1304
01:17:10.542 --> 01:17:12.269
...she wouldn't have cared to
take you all the way to Kolkata...

1305
01:17:14.417 --> 01:17:16.550
...so close your eyes
and sit quiet for sometime...

1306
01:17:16.750 --> 01:17:19.603
Sky won't fall if you don't hear
some words

1307
01:17:22.917 --> 01:17:26.385
if we keep going like this,
we will take forever to reach...

1308
01:17:30.875 --> 01:17:32.136
Ok shall we...?

1309
01:17:38.125 --> 01:17:42.765
But...what if on the way I
feel like passing motion...then...?

1310
01:17:48.167 --> 01:17:49.842
I'll stop the car...

1311
01:17:50.042 --> 01:17:52.717
...keep your throne on
the other side of the road...

1312
01:17:52.917 --> 01:17:54.473
...you can do what you need to...

1313
01:17:56.250 --> 01:17:57.260
alright...?

1314
01:17:58.042 --> 01:17:59.018
Good

1315
01:18:01.500 --> 01:18:02.476
Alright

1316
01:18:35.167 --> 01:18:36.769
Two hours more...

1317
01:18:49.167 --> 01:18:49.768
Sorry

1318
01:18:50.250 --> 01:18:51.135
Sleep...

1319
01:18:52.792 --> 01:18:53.643
Sure?

1320
01:18:54.792 --> 01:18:57.395
Will wake you up once we're there...

1321
01:18:58.875 --> 01:18:59.851
Thank you

1322
01:19:42.667 --> 01:19:46.726
Didi, they've arrived...
they've arrived

1323
01:19:47.250 --> 01:19:48.175
Hey Binod!

1324
01:19:48.375 --> 01:19:49.800
Brother!...come...come...

1325
01:19:50.000 --> 01:19:51.217
How are you Binod?

1326
01:19:51.417 --> 01:19:52.769
Come come come...all ok...?

1327
01:19:53.292 --> 01:19:54.848
Uncle you've lost weight...

1328
01:19:55.417 --> 01:19:58.760
Champa kunj...here I am...!

1329
01:19:59.042 --> 01:20:00.675
No no...whole night
we were just awake...

1330
01:20:00.875 --> 01:20:01.967
Brother...you must be very tired...?

1331
01:20:02.167 --> 01:20:03.217
lam fine...

1332
01:20:03.417 --> 01:20:04.643
Get the luggage

1333
01:20:05.042 --> 01:20:06.092
Nothing's changed here...

1334
01:20:06.292 --> 01:20:07.342
And whose idea was
it to do this road journey?

1335
01:20:07.542 --> 01:20:10.100
Goshh! you need
a heart to do that...

1336
01:20:12.042 --> 01:20:14.300
Rana...come...Kaku
he's Rana Choudhry...

1337
01:20:14.500 --> 01:20:15.842
Greetings...Mr Choudhry...
please sit...

1338
01:20:16.042 --> 01:20:19.225
Hey Binod, he's not Bengali...

1339
01:20:20.417 --> 01:20:22.425
He's the owner of Himachal
Tourist Taxi stand...

1340
01:20:22.625 --> 01:20:23.717
...his driver didn't
come so he drove us...

1341
01:20:23.917 --> 01:20:28.592
Oh...that means Delhi people aren't
as bad as we think them to be here...

1342
01:20:28.792 --> 01:20:29.717
Please don't mind...

1343
01:20:29.917 --> 01:20:33.260
Not her fault...well that is the
perception about Delhi people...

1344
01:20:33.750 --> 01:20:35.227
so...Piku...

1345
01:20:35.792 --> 01:20:36.967
...get that chair
in...I'll have to leave...

1346
01:20:37.167 --> 01:20:38.393
Where?

1347
01:20:38.667 --> 01:20:42.967
Where...you can't be going
back to Delhi right now...

1348
01:20:43.167 --> 01:20:44.342
...go tomorrow morning...

1349
01:20:44.542 --> 01:20:45.717
No its fine...really...I'll leave...

1350
01:20:45.917 --> 01:20:47.269
No one asked you...

1351
01:20:47.625 --> 01:20:48.300
Budhan...

1352
01:20:48.500 --> 01:20:49.092
<i>Yes</i>

1353
01:20:49.292 --> 01:20:50.300
Where have you kept my luggage...?

1354
01:20:50.500 --> 01:20:52.227
In that room down there...

1355
01:20:52.625 --> 01:20:56.389
No...keep it up
stairs...in that room...

1356
01:21:33.292 --> 01:21:35.300
"Where did that chair come from?"

1357
01:21:35.500 --> 01:21:37.217
That's grand pa's commode...

1358
01:21:37.417 --> 01:21:41.511
...don't touch it...haven't
cleaned it with an ANTISEPTIC yet..."

1359
01:21:51.417 --> 01:21:55.092
the whole feel of this house has
changed...because brother's here...

1360
01:21:55.292 --> 01:21:57.144
ya...but Piku...

1361
01:21:57.417 --> 01:21:59.474
...don't know what
she has grown up to be...

1362
01:22:00.542 --> 01:22:04.675
...first she <i>stays</i> with
her aunt Chhobi ...plus single...

1363
01:22:04.875 --> 01:22:05.717
...living in Delhi...

1364
01:22:05.917 --> 01:22:07.644
Hello...yes Nobendu...right...

1365
01:22:08.792 --> 01:22:11.270
...he has not told
me anything...why...

1366
01:22:13.042 --> 01:22:14.223
...oh...ok...

1367
01:22:14.750 --> 01:22:15.467
What happened?

1368
01:22:15.667 --> 01:22:19.635
Nobendu is saying...brother
has come to fix the house deal...

1369
01:22:20.042 --> 01:22:21.348
I am not surprised.

1370
01:22:21.917 --> 01:22:24.592
Must've done sitting in Delhi...

1371
01:22:24.792 --> 01:22:25.768
It can't be true...

1372
01:22:26.042 --> 01:22:28.967
I warned you...but
you shouted at me...

1373
01:22:29.167 --> 01:22:30.092
...now see for yourself...

1374
01:22:30.292 --> 01:22:34.056
...you respect him so much
but for him we are nobody...huh...

1375
01:22:41.375 --> 01:22:44.300
How's Dr Shrivastava?
He will miss you

1376
01:22:44.500 --> 01:22:45.425
I don't think so...

1377
01:22:45.625 --> 01:22:48.050
...Dad just forces
him to come everyday...

1378
01:22:48.250 --> 01:22:49.467
...I never force anybody, never.

1379
01:22:49.667 --> 01:22:52.592
There...Mr. Choudhary...join us

1380
01:22:52.792 --> 01:22:54.394
Pass me some pepper Piku...

1381
01:22:55.792 --> 01:22:58.550
I had no idea that your bowel
problem had become so chronic?

1382
01:22:58.750 --> 01:23:01.763
I don't think it's in our family...

1383
01:23:02.292 --> 01:23:03.143
Of course it is!

1384
01:23:04.042 --> 01:23:04.717
Our father had it!

1385
01:23:04.917 --> 01:23:05.717
But how would you remember...

1386
01:23:05.917 --> 01:23:09.092
...you were busy in fooling around
with life...fun...women.. all that.

1387
01:23:09.292 --> 01:23:13.135
Were the elders just watching
the show if he was fooling around...?

1388
01:23:13.625 --> 01:23:17.842
...and when sister in law and almost decided
to get him married to her sister Chhobi,

1389
01:23:18.042 --> 01:23:19.842
...then what was the
need to come and see me...?

1390
01:23:20.042 --> 01:23:24.887
Next day I had my M.Com exam...
final paper...but no one cared!

1391
01:23:25.917 --> 01:23:27.925
Mom just expressed
it to grandma that...

1392
01:23:28.125 --> 01:23:31.717
...its fun if two brother's
are married to two sisters...

1393
01:23:31.917 --> 01:23:33.467
...but its not that she
didn't love you when you came...

1394
01:23:33.667 --> 01:23:36.885
You were not even born
then Piku...how would you know

1395
01:23:38.917 --> 01:23:41.300
All I know is when mom
was in the hospital...she said...

1396
01:23:41.500 --> 01:23:43.592
...whenever I would get married,
you'll do the rituals on her behalf...

1397
01:23:43.792 --> 01:23:45.474
...not aunt Chhobi...

1398
01:23:45.875 --> 01:23:47.886
After mom, you are
like a mother to me

1399
01:23:48.125 --> 01:23:52.842
Why dig the old graves...she's come
here after so many years

1400
01:23:53.042 --> 01:23:53.717
But what did I say...

1401
01:23:53.917 --> 01:23:57.717
No no ...don't stop
her...she's right...

1402
01:23:57.917 --> 01:24:02.467
...this frustration
is not right...it causes...

1403
01:24:02.667 --> 01:24:03.217
Negativity

1404
01:24:03.417 --> 01:24:11.467
right...negativity...and
that causes indigestion and then...

1405
01:24:11.667 --> 01:24:12.768
Constipation...?

1406
01:24:13.167 --> 01:24:16.385
Amazing! How do you connect
everything with the stomach?

1407
01:24:16.917 --> 01:24:18.592
Coz everything is
connected to the stomach!

1408
01:24:18.792 --> 01:24:22.467
A person's emotion
depends on his motion...

1409
01:24:22.667 --> 01:24:25.270
This is all your nonsense
theory...in your own head...

1410
01:24:25.542 --> 01:24:27.092
...it's not that your
constipated all the time...?

1411
01:24:27.292 --> 01:24:28.342
Why're you getting angry with me...?

1412
01:24:28.542 --> 01:24:29.967
lam not getting angry...

1413
01:24:30.167 --> 01:24:33.592
...but you don't discuss
anything other than this Dad...

1414
01:24:33.792 --> 01:24:34.550
...there's a limit...

1415
01:24:34.750 --> 01:24:35.800
Just relax brother...

1416
01:24:36.000 --> 01:24:36.885
I am relaxed

1417
01:24:37.125 --> 01:24:38.342
And you don't talk much...!

1418
01:24:38.542 --> 01:24:42.717
Do you know Piku...for how
long your uncle sits on the pot...?

1419
01:24:42.917 --> 01:24:44.300
What do you mean...

1420
01:24:44.500 --> 01:24:46.717
...father had
constipation...brother has...

1421
01:24:46.917 --> 01:24:49.217
...and you also have the same
...its in the family...

1422
01:24:49.417 --> 01:24:49.925
No brother...

1423
01:24:50.125 --> 01:24:51.592
Yes father had...

1424
01:24:51.792 --> 01:24:52.723
No...

1425
01:24:53.667 --> 01:24:55.717
You had constipation.

1426
01:24:55.917 --> 01:24:57.269
Why are you looking at me?

1427
01:24:58.917 --> 01:25:01.342
...Uncle you know about
the water shortage in Delhi...

1428
01:25:01.542 --> 01:25:03.842
...still he wants a bucket
full of water...

1429
01:25:04.042 --> 01:25:06.217
...because he's not satisfied
with that jet spray...

1430
01:25:06.417 --> 01:25:10.967
No that's because that jet has a sharp
flow of water...it hurts me here...

1431
01:25:11.167 --> 01:25:14.100
And in winters he
demands hot water...

1432
01:25:14.417 --> 01:25:17.976
...now tell me who needs hot
water to clean his...back side?

1433
01:25:21.125 --> 01:25:24.342
You must know that every third person
in America has the same problem...

1434
01:25:24.542 --> 01:25:26.717
...in fact constipation
is their biggest health issue...

1435
01:25:26.917 --> 01:25:28.092
Really?
- Of course!

1436
01:25:28.292 --> 01:25:29.717
...still they live care free...

1437
01:25:29.917 --> 01:25:31.769
...looking at their faces can you ever
tell what's going on inside them...?

1438
01:25:32.000 --> 01:25:33.842
Who cares? They're the
biggest economy in the world

1439
01:25:34.042 --> 01:25:34.927
No no...I care...

1440
01:25:38.917 --> 01:25:41.925
How can you call yourself
normal so confidently...

1441
01:25:42.125 --> 01:25:44.800
Hear me out...for any normal person,
a breakfast,

1442
01:25:45.000 --> 01:25:45.842
...a lunch and a dinner...

1443
01:25:46.042 --> 01:25:49.675
...these three meals is all that is needed
to smoothly do the job next morning...

1444
01:25:49.875 --> 01:25:53.675
...but they...on an average
go once in three days!

1445
01:25:53.875 --> 01:25:56.092
All through the day
they just eat junk...

1446
01:25:56.292 --> 01:25:57.592
...collecting inside
as if a fixed deposit...

1447
01:25:57.792 --> 01:25:58.592
...and then one day they
go...and well...do it...

1448
01:25:58.792 --> 01:25:59.723
Chchii!!

1449
01:26:00.667 --> 01:26:02.599
No no seriously...don't laugh...

1450
01:26:03.167 --> 01:26:05.270
and your condition isn't that bad...

1451
01:26:05.500 --> 01:26:13.894
...do one thing..-just chew
your food like this...like a cow".

1452
01:26:14.292 --> 01:26:17.271
...next day you're bound
to have a clear motion...

1453
01:26:17.792 --> 01:26:20.145
cow?

1454
01:26:21.417 --> 01:26:24.467
Mr. Banerjee have you ever heard a
cow or a buffalo ever getting constipated...

1455
01:26:24.667 --> 01:26:28.226
...or doing a hard cow dung...or
loose...think about it...

1456
01:26:30.375 --> 01:26:31.727
Tell me

1457
01:26:34.875 --> 01:26:36.675
Right...his logic is right

1458
01:26:36.875 --> 01:26:38.511
Are you sure you are not a Bengali?

1459
01:26:38.750 --> 01:26:40.853
Sir not everything is
a copyright by Bengalis...

1460
01:26:42.042 --> 01:26:44.019
You didn't know this...?

1461
01:26:44.792 --> 01:26:45.768
No.

1462
01:26:50.125 --> 01:26:51.550
There was a railing there?

1463
01:26:51.750 --> 01:26:52.467
I think...ya...

1464
01:26:52.667 --> 01:26:54.644
That was a new
construction...needs repair

1465
01:26:54.917 --> 01:26:55.675
Will get it done...

1466
01:26:55.875 --> 01:26:58.763
You're family is
quite interesting...

1467
01:27:00.042 --> 01:27:04.010
just because everyone laughed,
don't think everyone is impressed...

1468
01:27:04.292 --> 01:27:05.518
...we are very critical people...

1469
01:27:05.750 --> 01:27:10.014
Oh I know...some people just
can't like anyone...it's Ok...

1470
01:27:10.667 --> 01:27:11.768
you think I am like that...?

1471
01:27:12.292 --> 01:27:14.092
You are...but...can't
blame you for it...

1472
01:27:14.292 --> 01:27:16.925
...actually after a certain
age...one becomes like that...

1473
01:27:17.125 --> 01:27:18.050
...difficult to please...

1474
01:27:18.250 --> 01:27:20.512
Then don't try to...'please'

1475
01:27:21.000 --> 01:27:21.885
Ok...

1476
01:27:22.292 --> 01:27:23.518
Do you know Piku...

1477
01:27:23.750 --> 01:27:29.721
Binod was in secondary when our
father started building this house...

1478
01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:32.717
And same year brother
also got a job in ITC...

1479
01:27:32.917 --> 01:27:35.717
37, Virginia house,
CHOWRANGEE LANE...

1480
01:27:35.917 --> 01:27:37.473
You remember...?

1481
01:27:38.667 --> 01:27:40.217
Earlier we just had ground floor...

1482
01:27:40.417 --> 01:27:42.842
...when they shifted here,
that's when this 1st floor was made...

1483
01:27:43.042 --> 01:27:45.520
Ok listen...my head...

1484
01:27:48.500 --> 01:27:50.352
Can we go out somewhere“?

1485
01:27:54.292 --> 01:27:56.717
Ya...I'll just give
dad his medicines...

1486
01:27:56.917 --> 01:27:59.896
...the centre of my circumference...

1487
01:28:01.500 --> 01:28:03.550
...I feel is this
place...this courtyard...

1488
01:28:03.750 --> 01:28:06.342
Then after retirement why
did you settle down in Delhi...?

1489
01:28:06.542 --> 01:28:09.550
You knew your brother doesn't
earn <i>as</i> much as you did...

1490
01:28:09.750 --> 01:28:10.967
...to maintain this house...

1491
01:28:11.167 --> 01:28:11.967
Can you keep quiet?

1492
01:28:12.167 --> 01:28:12.717
Why should I?

1493
01:28:12.917 --> 01:28:15.395
No no...carry on...she's right..

1494
01:28:15.667 --> 01:28:19.592
...a woman as educated <i>as</i> her should
not be stopped from speaking her mind...

1495
01:28:19.792 --> 01:28:20.800
...but tell me Moni...

1496
01:28:21.000 --> 01:28:26.092
...in 1979 who wrote that job application
for you in that BATA company...?

1497
01:28:26.292 --> 01:28:29.550
I had my connections there...still
you didn't take up that job...why?

1498
01:28:29.750 --> 01:28:32.050
...because then my salary
would've been more than his...

1499
01:28:32.250 --> 01:28:34.342
That's exactly what
I call a low IQ thinking...

1500
01:28:34.542 --> 01:28:36.592
...you yourself are responsible
for your frustrations...

1501
01:28:36.792 --> 01:28:42.387
...no one else...anyways...such
old memories coming back...

1502
01:28:43.792 --> 01:28:45.717
remember Binod...after
mother passed away,

1503
01:28:45.917 --> 01:28:51.854
her body was kept here...head
that side...legs here...

1504
01:28:52.292 --> 01:28:55.635
And then Piku's mother's
body...that too...

1505
01:29:02.917 --> 01:29:04.269
Piku lets go

1506
01:29:05.917 --> 01:29:06.467
Where...?

1507
01:29:06.667 --> 01:29:08.342
We'll just go out...just...

1508
01:29:08.542 --> 01:29:09.393
But where?

1509
01:29:09.750 --> 01:29:11.136
Kolkata tour

1510
01:29:11.542 --> 01:29:13.895
Hey Piku...Don't be late...

1511
01:29:14.292 --> 01:29:15.598
Ya I'll come soon...

1512
01:29:18.917 --> 01:29:20.678
If you're <i>so</i> emotionally
attached to this place...

1513
01:29:24.042 --> 01:29:26.600
What? Have you lost it?

1514
01:29:26.875 --> 01:29:28.592
Brick by brick I've
constructed this house...

1515
01:29:28.792 --> 01:29:32.260
CHAMPA KUNJ can't be sold
ever...it will never be sold!

1516
01:29:33.417 --> 01:29:34.717
Our mother's name...CHAMPA...
that's written on it...Got it?!

1517
01:29:34.917 --> 01:29:35.677
But brother...

1518
01:29:50.000 --> 01:29:51.056
Take a right from here

1519
01:29:56.417 --> 01:30:00.886
Mom used to teach here...then
she met Dad and got married...

1520
01:30:01.292 --> 01:30:02.268
And left the job?

1521
01:30:03.542 --> 01:30:04.723
Yes

1522
01:30:15.417 --> 01:30:17.645
...why don't you
elope and get married...

1523
01:30:18.417 --> 01:30:20.019
he's not that bad...

1524
01:30:20.625 --> 01:30:23.137
...moreover you need
someone to run away with...

1525
01:30:25.792 --> 01:30:27.018
...why didn't you marry...?

1526
01:30:29.667 --> 01:30:31.800
Next stop coffee shop
hhuuhh and then by the Ganges

1527
01:30:32.000 --> 01:30:33.602
Okay

1528
01:30:36.417 --> 01:30:39.509
There used to be a theater
here...and now a building...

1529
01:30:39.792 --> 01:30:40.842
That's what happens usually...

1530
01:30:41.042 --> 01:30:42.467
...don't you want
to sell off your house?

1531
01:30:42.667 --> 01:30:44.144
One day a building
will come up there too...

1532
01:30:45.500 --> 01:30:46.852
I am just being practical...

1533
01:30:47.167 --> 01:30:49.520
No no I am not saying
you're wrong...

1534
01:30:51.042 --> 01:30:52.553
...may be this is the way forward...

1535
01:30:56.167 --> 01:30:59.259
...but if you pull your roots out...

1536
01:30:59.917 --> 01:31:01.519
...what will remain...

1537
01:31:01.875 --> 01:31:03.511
...you know what I mean...

1538
01:31:26.292 --> 01:31:29.225
Yes Dad...Crataegus

1539
01:31:30.167 --> 01:31:35.512
Carbo veg...6-7
drops...yes I am coming.

1540
01:31:37.542 --> 01:31:39.645
You guys must not be
having any medical expenses...

1541
01:31:39.917 --> 01:31:42.020
...looks like you manage
your own treatment...

1542
01:31:42.750 --> 01:31:43.760
Ya...

1543
01:31:44.292 --> 01:31:47.635
How old is you father...must
be at least 70?

1544
01:31:48.542 --> 01:31:49.518
Hmm exact

1545
01:31:49.792 --> 01:31:51.842
And the way you're being his doctor,

1546
01:31:52.042 --> 01:31:55.601
he'll be around for another 20
more years...which makes him 90.

1547
01:31:56.417 --> 01:31:57.092
Touchwood...

1548
01:31:57.292 --> 01:32:03.138
And in next 20 years, you too
will become 50...approximately?

1549
01:32:06.500 --> 01:32:07.635
Hmm?
<i>'</i> 30...?

1550
01:32:08.292 --> 01:32:11.145
50...in just taking
care of your father?

1551
01:32:11.500 --> 01:32:14.513
One minute...why are
you saying all this...

1552
01:32:15.042 --> 01:32:15.967
...you know my situation...?

1553
01:32:16.167 --> 01:32:17.467
You know he's dependent on me?

1554
01:32:17.667 --> 01:32:21.467
Can't hear or see
properly...should I leave him?

1555
01:32:21.667 --> 01:32:22.092
No no...

1556
01:32:22.292 --> 01:32:23.342
How will he manage on his own?

1557
01:32:23.542 --> 01:32:26.600
I am not asking you to leave him..
even I haven't left my mother...

1558
01:32:27.042 --> 01:32:31.842
...I am just saying I hope
you realize he is a selfish man...

1559
01:32:32.042 --> 01:32:32.592
...no he's not...

1560
01:32:32.792 --> 01:32:33.893
Ya he is

1561
01:32:35.000 --> 01:32:37.262
and even if he is
...he's my father...

1562
01:32:37.667 --> 01:32:39.895
If he's your father then
why do behave like his mother?

1563
01:32:41.250 --> 01:32:44.513
Because Rana, after a certain
age parents can't live on their own,

1564
01:32:44.917 --> 01:32:47.145
...they need to be kept alive...

1565
01:32:47.375 --> 01:32:49.136
...and that responsibility
is of kids only...

1566
01:32:53.292 --> 01:32:54.800
...so if someone
wants to marry me...

1567
01:32:55.000 --> 01:32:56.717
He'll have to adopt
your 90 year old kid too...?

1568
01:32:56.917 --> 01:32:58.269
Of course...

1569
01:33:03.375 --> 01:33:05.102
...will you marry me?

1570
01:33:09.500 --> 01:33:11.136
I haven't gone mad...

1571
01:33:12.542 --> 01:33:14.144
Then don't worry about me...

1572
01:33:14.417 --> 01:33:16.349
No no I am not worrying

1573
01:33:16.917 --> 01:33:21.842
dad used to take us there...to show steamers
...there can you see...there...?

1574
01:33:22.042 --> 01:33:25.925
Please come down,
Aunt Chhobi is here...

1575
01:33:26.125 --> 01:33:32.050
oh...Bhaku da...Piku...Binod...
how are you all?

1576
01:33:32.250 --> 01:33:33.467
Wait wait...am coming

1577
01:33:33.667 --> 01:33:34.467
How come...why...I mean...

1578
01:33:34.667 --> 01:33:35.342
there... surprised you!...

1579
01:33:35.542 --> 01:33:36.175
Surprise...well...

1580
01:33:36.375 --> 01:33:37.175
Where's Piku?

1581
01:33:37.375 --> 01:33:38.385
Piku's gone out...

1582
01:33:39.417 --> 01:33:40.092
Aunty...

1583
01:33:40.292 --> 01:33:42.550
Your uncle suddenly
made a plan for Darjeeling,

1584
01:33:42.750 --> 01:33:46.967
...so I thought I'll meet you
all on the way...now come fast..

1585
01:33:47.167 --> 01:33:48.769
Ok ok

1586
01:34:00.792 --> 01:34:02.895
Thank you dear...cheers!

1587
01:34:03.292 --> 01:34:06.145
Bhaku da...hey Bhaku da

1588
01:34:06.542 --> 01:34:09.976
What is it...why is your mood off?
Now you're in Kolkata...

1589
01:34:13.000 --> 01:34:15.550
no...I am thinking...

1590
01:34:15.750 --> 01:34:17.842
about Piku? No point...that
Sourobh is already married now...

1591
01:34:18.042 --> 01:34:21.717
...you didn't like him...so what's
the need of this 'thinking' now...?

1592
01:34:21.917 --> 01:34:25.050
lam thinking...when
will you spare me...

1593
01:34:25.250 --> 01:34:26.050
as in...?

1594
01:34:26.250 --> 01:34:28.592
I can't believe...you've
come here too...

1595
01:34:28.792 --> 01:34:31.600
ok...so if you've such
issues with me...I'll go

1596
01:34:34.167 --> 01:34:38.175
Last night I saw you seeing Piku...

1597
01:34:38.375 --> 01:34:39.342
Can I go Dad?

1598
01:34:39.542 --> 01:34:40.300
No...

1599
01:34:40.500 --> 01:34:41.717
I was looking at you...

1600
01:34:41.917 --> 01:34:45.467
Oh really, say the truth
or else you'll be in trouble

1601
01:34:45.667 --> 01:34:46.467
Want enema...?

1602
01:34:46.667 --> 01:34:48.717
Look I am not meditating here...

1603
01:34:48.917 --> 01:34:50.675
I am ready for fourth marriage also

1604
01:34:50.875 --> 01:34:53.425
If you've done little...then
do the rest later...

1605
01:34:53.625 --> 01:34:55.102
lets end this here for today...

1606
01:34:58.500 --> 01:35:01.592
So Mr.Choudhry...
ready to go back to Delhi...?

1607
01:35:02.042 --> 01:35:03.175
Oh done with badminton...?

1608
01:35:03.375 --> 01:35:06.137
Yeah...why...?

1609
01:35:06.542 --> 01:35:07.717
So who all are there in your family?

1610
01:35:07.917 --> 01:35:11.851
My sister,
mother...and father passed away...

1611
01:35:12.167 --> 01:35:13.519
...father died...?

1612
01:35:13.917 --> 01:35:17.842
Death...who said death? Who's death?

1613
01:35:18.042 --> 01:35:19.425
Rama's father...he died...

1614
01:35:19.625 --> 01:35:20.342
Not now, long back...

1615
01:35:20.542 --> 01:35:21.342
What was the problem?

1616
01:35:21.542 --> 01:35:22.550
No problem as such...

1617
01:35:22.750 --> 01:35:23.717
Died without any problem?

1618
01:35:23.917 --> 01:35:24.967
I mean he had cancer...

1619
01:35:25.167 --> 01:35:27.717
So cancer is a problem...why
are you saying he had no problem?

1620
01:35:27.917 --> 01:35:29.675
...well he had cancer
but it was removed...

1621
01:35:29.875 --> 01:35:31.727
Oh ok...Where was it?

1622
01:35:33.292 --> 01:35:33.842
Throat...

1623
01:35:34.042 --> 01:35:35.967
Throat...aah smoking is it?

1624
01:35:36.167 --> 01:35:37.143
Where are you going...?

1625
01:35:37.625 --> 01:35:43.016
So they must've done tracheotomy
..for him to breathe..

1626
01:35:43.792 --> 01:35:45.519
Did they reconstruct Food pipe also?

1627
01:35:45.917 --> 01:35:47.175
Ya something like that...

1628
01:35:47.375 --> 01:35:49.092
What do you mean
something like that...?

1629
01:35:49.292 --> 01:35:49.717
I mean...

1630
01:35:49.917 --> 01:35:50.800
You should know what
all the doctor did.

1631
01:35:51.000 --> 01:35:53.092
Dad everyone is not
so interested in all this...

1632
01:35:53.292 --> 01:35:55.675
...this medical nonsense
has become your hobby...

1633
01:35:55.875 --> 01:35:56.842
hey I am not talking to you...

1634
01:35:57.042 --> 01:35:58.092
lam also not talking to you...!

1635
01:35:58.292 --> 01:35:58.967
Then...

1636
01:35:59.167 --> 01:36:00.925
hey...listen where are
you going...then what happened?

1637
01:36:01.125 --> 01:36:05.217
Nothing...he was in the ICU...
and then on a ventilator and...

1638
01:36:05.417 --> 01:36:08.592
VENTILATOR?! You should've
not put him on a Ventilator...

1639
01:36:08.792 --> 01:36:09.592
...it is wrong...

1640
01:36:09.792 --> 01:36:12.342
Piku what he did to his father,
you don't do that with me,

1641
01:36:12.542 --> 01:36:15.092
I'm telling you...you see...all
this is commercial business...

1642
01:36:15.292 --> 01:36:18.050
professional money making...
why did you allow them to do it?

1643
01:36:18.250 --> 01:36:19.217
Allow...I mean...I was...

1644
01:36:19.417 --> 01:36:21.717
No no but why...why did you allow
them to do this to your father...

1645
01:36:21.917 --> 01:36:23.300
look my father was on death bed...

1646
01:36:23.500 --> 01:36:24.550
...doctor said we needed
to put him on the ventilator...

1647
01:36:24.750 --> 01:36:25.342
...so what could've I done?

1648
01:36:25.542 --> 01:36:28.467
I couldn't have said
no...it's not my decision...

1649
01:36:28.667 --> 01:36:32.217
Of course it is! Do you've any idea how
much pain your father went through?

1650
01:36:32.417 --> 01:36:33.925
...his whole body must've
been pricked with needles...

1651
01:36:34.125 --> 01:36:37.717
...drip...blood...catheter
down below...ECG machine...

1652
01:36:37.917 --> 01:36:41.100
...it's inhuman treatment...you
tortured your father!

1653
01:36:41.542 --> 01:36:44.592
You get up if the Nurse picks you up...
be at her mercy to change your clothes...

1654
01:36:44.792 --> 01:36:46.550
...and if you've passed motion in those
clothes, then just keep lying down,

1655
01:36:46.750 --> 01:36:48.386
...waiting for her again...
oh gosh...no!!

1656
01:36:49.500 --> 01:36:55.767
Look Piku...when I die, don't do all this
with me...I want to die in peace...!

1657
01:37:03.167 --> 01:37:04.598
DO you always have to over do it!

1658
01:37:05.000 --> 01:37:08.425
But...I was only telling
you what not to do with me...

1659
01:37:08.625 --> 01:37:13.014
why did he go?
did I say anything to him? No!

1660
01:37:14.625 --> 01:37:16.227
Rana brother...

1661
01:37:18.000 --> 01:37:22.344
...grand pa has sent this
for you and has called you down...

1662
01:37:37.917 --> 01:37:43.262
you don't need to be sorry... I didn't
feel bad...I am fine...it's ok...

1663
01:37:43.542 --> 01:37:45.019
Sorry? for...?

1664
01:37:45.417 --> 01:37:47.217
...check that...our
water pump is not working...

1665
01:37:47.417 --> 01:37:50.976
...you did civil right?
you did civil engineering...check it...

1666
01:37:54.167 --> 01:37:59.228
What? There...water...water
pump...its not working...

1667
01:37:59.917 --> 01:38:01.592
Call an electrician...its
not my job...

1668
01:38:01.792 --> 01:38:03.675
What do you mean...its not
your job...you must be knowing?

1669
01:38:03.875 --> 01:38:06.425
Ok fine...I know...but I am getting late
so you call anyone else...I need to go...

1670
01:38:06.625 --> 01:38:07.342
you're going now?

1671
01:38:07.542 --> 01:38:08.925
Who who's going...No
no how can you go...?

1672
01:38:09.125 --> 01:38:11.217
There's no water in the over
head tank..or in the bathroom...

1673
01:38:11.417 --> 01:38:12.675
...or the flush...how can he go?

1674
01:38:12.875 --> 01:38:16.889
I don't care... water or no water...
in flush or tank or wherever else...

1675
01:38:17.417 --> 01:38:18.592
...its a plumber's job...not mine...

1676
01:38:18.792 --> 01:38:19.342
What?

1677
01:38:19.542 --> 01:38:21.217
How will I cook?...
there's no water in the kitchen...

1678
01:38:21.417 --> 01:38:24.175
As if you were making
Mutton kebabs...? Huh!

1679
01:38:24.375 --> 01:38:26.675
Fish rice...but that too I can't
cook now..we'll have to order in

1680
01:38:26.875 --> 01:38:30.925
No mutton kebabs, Dr.Shrivastava
told me eat only pulses and rice..

1681
01:38:31.125 --> 01:38:34.467
But brother how will she
cook rice...that needs water too

1682
01:38:34.667 --> 01:38:35.925
Binod it's a useless argument...

1683
01:38:36.125 --> 01:38:37.800
oh she just needs an
excuse to avoid cooking

1684
01:38:38.000 --> 01:38:38.885
What a useless argument“!

1685
01:38:39.375 --> 01:38:40.636
Shut up!

1686
01:38:45.125 --> 01:38:46.511
Where's the water pump...?

1687
01:38:54.167 --> 01:38:55.644
Its on...check the water flow...

1688
01:38:56.042 --> 01:38:57.769
Not coming...

1689
01:39:13.792 --> 01:39:14.893
Are you angry?

1690
01:39:15.417 --> 01:39:16.769
Not your fault...

1691
01:39:20.167 --> 01:39:21.092
Now...?

1692
01:39:21.292 --> 01:39:23.520
Not yet...

1693
01:39:26.250 --> 01:39:27.727
Am I irritating you?

1694
01:39:29.292 --> 01:39:31.395
I have a good tolerance...

1695
01:39:32.750 --> 01:39:35.763
That means I am
talking to you forcibly

1696
01:39:37.000 --> 01:39:38.636
<i>'IQ-am</i>

1697
01:39:39.042 --> 01:39:41.520
god...just like
dad...ditto...same...

1698
01:39:41.792 --> 01:39:43.519
Don't compare me with that man..

1699
01:39:44.000 --> 01:39:46.262
Water is coming...little...

1700
01:39:50.417 --> 01:39:54.010
With your attitude, you won't
find any companion your entire life...

1701
01:39:55.500 --> 01:39:57.467
Its not like that...if
I seek actively,

1702
01:39:57.667 --> 01:40:00.520
somebody or the other
I'll definitely find...

1703
01:40:02.125 --> 01:40:03.592
...worry about your self...

1704
01:40:03.792 --> 01:40:07.010
...god forbid you shouldn't be left with
Budhan for company in your old age.

1705
01:40:07.750 --> 01:40:10.387
I'm serious...just be aware...

1706
01:40:10.875 --> 01:40:14.263
its better that you leave...really

1707
01:40:16.917 --> 01:40:19.896
And there's Water now...

1708
01:40:20.667 --> 01:40:22.217
Fine now I am also leaving...

1709
01:40:22.417 --> 01:40:24.224
There's Water

1710
01:40:24.500 --> 01:40:26.932
See I told you he'll repair it

1711
01:40:30.250 --> 01:40:34.719
Thank you...Thank you Mr.Choudhary
thank you so much...thank you

1712
01:40:35.917 --> 01:40:38.645
Now you can leave...better
to take breaks...

1713
01:40:39.417 --> 01:40:42.885
Ya I'll see where I get by
the evening...ok...I'll leave...

1714
01:40:43.917 --> 01:40:45.342
You could've stayed
for a day or two more...

1715
01:40:45.542 --> 01:40:48.967
Why? Not needed,
he has his business there...

1716
01:40:49.167 --> 01:40:56.890
...his family...no no you must go...
and once you get there...inform me...

1717
01:40:58.292 --> 01:41:02.010
Do you know what the real
issue is...Mr. Banerjee...

1718
01:41:02.417 --> 01:41:03.467
What?

1719
01:41:03.667 --> 01:41:05.974
No one understands you...

1720
01:41:11.250 --> 01:41:12.511
You're right...

1721
01:41:13.375 --> 01:41:14.425
can I suggest something?

1722
01:41:14.625 --> 01:41:15.300
Yes tell me

1723
01:41:15.500 --> 01:41:17.261
Will you listen...
- Yes yes tell me...

1724
01:41:18.917 --> 01:41:20.894
stop hiding salt...

1725
01:41:28.250 --> 01:41:30.175
hey...Mister...hey...wait wait wait...

1726
01:41:30.375 --> 01:41:34.969
In straight and simple words...stop
being so difficult...alright?

1727
01:41:41.500 --> 01:41:45.264
Do you meditate...?...

1728
01:41:47.042 --> 01:41:50.225
Piku sister...all
well...greetings!...

1729
01:41:51.250 --> 01:41:55.467
With this kind of a family...at
least someone should stay calm...

1730
01:41:55.667 --> 01:41:59.967
...balanced...you must begin...
you'll stay relaxed

1731
01:42:00.167 --> 01:42:01.268
I am relaxed...

1732
01:42:01.500 --> 01:42:02.977
ls it?...

1733
01:42:07.667 --> 01:42:09.144
...I'll call you...

1734
01:42:12.500 --> 01:42:15.137
By the way my family is totally...

1735
01:42:20.292 --> 01:42:22.842
...you thought you'll play this game
and we'll sell off the house...?

1736
01:42:23.042 --> 01:42:25.967
No no elder brother...that
builder said..otherwise later...

1737
01:42:26.167 --> 01:42:28.092
Later means when?

1738
01:42:28.292 --> 01:42:30.592
Later even if all
these people have died...

1739
01:42:30.792 --> 01:42:33.675
I'll be still alive...
to take care about this house Ok...

1740
01:42:33.875 --> 01:42:35.967
Why will you take
care of our house...?

1741
01:42:36.167 --> 01:42:36.842
Later when...?

1742
01:42:37.042 --> 01:42:40.760
Aunty...Champa Kunj
will not be sold.

1743
01:42:41.792 --> 01:42:46.011
And if uncle has no objection
then lets find a tenant...ok...

1744
01:42:47.292 --> 01:42:48.473
thank you...

1745
01:42:52.417 --> 01:42:54.849
Now you leave...ok?...

1746
01:42:55.667 --> 01:43:01.103
What nonsense...waste of time...

1747
01:43:37.042 --> 01:43:40.225
Ok Piku...
- Bye... bye

1748
01:44:08.542 --> 01:44:10.925
Hey wait...is this your cycle?

1749
01:44:11.125 --> 01:44:12.477
Yes

1750
01:44:13.625 --> 01:44:18.845
Ya Syed,
I don't know when I'll come...

1751
01:44:51.375 --> 01:44:52.636
How did he even go?...

1752
01:44:53.042 --> 01:44:54.592
and why did you not wake me up...?

1753
01:44:54.792 --> 01:44:56.967
But you know him Piku...

1754
01:44:57.167 --> 01:44:58.967
Why didn't you lock the cycle...?

1755
01:44:59.167 --> 01:45:01.019
He'd taken the keys last night...

1756
01:45:02.542 --> 01:45:05.270
I've searched for him everywhere
but I couldn't find him

1757
01:45:05.542 --> 01:45:09.010
Go and check once again

1758
01:45:10.667 --> 01:45:13.759
whole life he kept mom
also stuck in all this...!

1759
01:45:14.292 --> 01:45:18.511
She sacrificed her own happiness
to tolerate all his tantrums...

1760
01:45:18.792 --> 01:45:20.300
...he said I want
to go to Kolkata...

1761
01:45:20.500 --> 01:45:22.842
...so I said fine...I left
everything and came with him...

1762
01:45:23.042 --> 01:45:24.644
...see what he is doing now...?

1763
01:45:25.792 --> 01:45:27.599
What if he falls
down on the road...?

1764
01:46:33.042 --> 01:46:35.019
He's here...

1765
01:46:52.417 --> 01:46:57.262
I saw everything...
Writers Building...

1766
01:46:57.750 --> 01:47:06.270
Dalhousie...Shyam Bazar...
and these dumplings...

1767
01:47:12.542 --> 01:47:13.967
Who'll eat all this

1768
01:47:14.167 --> 01:47:17.300
Because of him all my life I
have eaten pumpkin... bitter gourd...

1769
01:47:17.500 --> 01:47:19.967
...and now he wants to eat this...

1770
01:47:20.167 --> 01:47:21.974
...sweets and what not...

1771
01:47:22.250 --> 01:47:23.761
...get Medicine from inside,

1772
01:47:25.292 --> 01:47:26.717
I know what drama
is going to happen now...

1773
01:47:26.917 --> 01:47:30.175
I am fine...no drama will happen

1774
01:47:30.375 --> 01:47:31.592
You are not fine dad...

1775
01:47:31.792 --> 01:47:32.925
and I will cycle tomorrow also...

1776
01:47:33.125 --> 01:47:34.592
No you will not! Do you get that...?

1777
01:47:34.792 --> 01:47:38.260
One month ago he had collapsed..
his BP had dropped...

1778
01:47:38.542 --> 01:47:43.261
...suddenly one fine day you
can't cycle for 25 kilometers..

1779
01:47:45.250 --> 01:47:47.800
...you think your lungs
are fit to do all this nonsense...

1780
01:47:48.000 --> 01:47:50.425
...your Heart cannot take it,
you are 70 yrs old...!

1781
01:47:50.625 --> 01:47:51.675
Just doesn't listen.

1782
01:47:51.875 --> 01:47:55.514
I said we'll take a flight
but no he wanted to go by road only!

1783
01:47:57.542 --> 01:48:00.100
Have you ever thought what I want?

1784
01:48:00.750 --> 01:48:02.511
Absolutely Selfish!!!

1785
01:48:05.417 --> 01:48:07.342
Yes, I've had physical
relationships...

1786
01:48:07.542 --> 01:48:09.842
...but is this something
he needs to tell every man I meet?

1787
01:48:10.042 --> 01:48:13.925
That meet my daughter she is not a..
virgin..which father does this?

1788
01:48:14.125 --> 01:48:17.104
Calm down piku...have some water

1789
01:48:32.917 --> 01:48:33.643
What?

1790
01:48:37.167 --> 01:48:37.893
Aahh

1791
01:48:39.667 --> 01:48:44.092
Rana was right...one
should eat everything...

1792
01:48:44.292 --> 01:48:45.268
Done?

1793
01:48:45.875 --> 01:48:51.015
Like never before...Piku!

1794
01:48:51.667 --> 01:48:55.385
...extraordinary...! best motion!

1795
01:49:00.167 --> 01:49:02.717
Good...so no cycling
from tomorrow...

1796
01:49:02.917 --> 01:49:05.550
I understand
you all are angry...

1797
01:49:05.750 --> 01:49:11.516
...but everyone's way
to go has been decided...

1798
01:49:11.917 --> 01:49:15.300
...even mine...
I know...even mine...it will be

1799
01:49:15.500 --> 01:49:20.015
...through my digestive track...
my life will go from here...

1800
01:49:20.750 --> 01:49:24.514
...so let me cycle...I am enjoying...

1801
01:49:25.042 --> 01:49:29.386
...hey Binod...tomorrow...

1802
01:49:37.125 --> 01:49:38.342
Piku...Piku...

1803
01:49:38.542 --> 01:49:39.592
Haan Kaku?

1804
01:49:39.792 --> 01:49:40.643
Piku...

1805
01:49:42.375 --> 01:49:46.842
See what's happened to brother...
didn't wake up with an alarm also...

1806
01:49:47.042 --> 01:49:49.520
...I also woke him...but
he says nothing...

1807
01:49:50.625 --> 01:49:53.353
Moni..Moni..come fast

1808
01:49:57.792 --> 01:49:58.342
Grand pa...

1809
01:49:58.542 --> 01:50:03.102
I switched on the
light in the morning

1810
01:50:04.292 --> 01:50:07.145
He didn't get up...

1811
01:50:10.417 --> 01:50:11.217
Get up grand pa...

1812
01:50:11.417 --> 01:50:12.393
Moni..

1813
01:50:13.500 --> 01:50:15.352
What happened...?

1814
01:50:18.000 --> 01:50:21.263
Call Dr.Ghosh..

1815
01:50:22.042 --> 01:50:24.099
Grand pa...

1816
01:50:42.708 --> 01:50:46.347
Piku... hey Piku

1817
01:51:34.875 --> 01:51:37.550
Oh..that means either
Cardiac Arrhythmia..

1818
01:51:37.750 --> 01:51:39.511
Basically irregular heartbeat..

1819
01:51:39.792 --> 01:51:41.144
...or Sleep Apnea..

1820
01:51:43.042 --> 01:51:46.385
...respected brother always
wished for a peaceful death

1821
01:51:46.792 --> 01:51:49.884
Yes uncle, no tube..no ventilation.

1822
01:51:51.292 --> 01:51:56.637
...dad was happy,
he said it was the best motion...

1823
01:51:59.750 --> 01:52:05.846
...he always forced me to listen to him
but he made sure death also listened to him

1824
01:53:08.917 --> 01:53:12.009
let me tell you
all..dad was in peace..

1825
01:53:12.500 --> 01:53:15.888
...he was in no pain..

1826
01:53:16.792 --> 01:53:22.854
...and those who know dad..they know he
had just one problem. constipation..

1827
01:53:24.250 --> 01:53:26.637
...but that too got
cured before he left..

1828
01:53:27.500 --> 01:53:31.844
...so dad's death was a happy
one and I'm going to miss him...

1829
01:53:33.417 --> 01:53:36.600
now no one will call
me from this room, Piku..Piku..

1830
01:53:37.000 --> 01:53:40.842
Bhashkor da was a
big attention seeker..

1831
01:53:41.042 --> 01:53:46.228
...if that man sees Piku is here
all sad, roaming with her hair open...

1832
01:53:46.542 --> 01:53:49.145
...he'll come immediately
and take her away too..

1833
01:53:51.375 --> 01:53:54.137
Piku...I love Bhaskor da, ..

1834
01:53:59.875 --> 01:54:02.012
Piku...come here for a minute

1835
01:54:02.417 --> 01:54:05.092
or maybe he has already
made a plan of coming back...

1836
01:54:05.292 --> 01:54:06.342
...as Piku's kid...

1837
01:54:06.542 --> 01:54:09.342
daughter..don't mind me saying
but I need to tell you something..

1838
01:54:09.542 --> 01:54:10.967
...but I will pray to
god...if he comes again...

1839
01:54:11.167 --> 01:54:12.925
...then he should come
without constipation"

1840
01:54:13.125 --> 01:54:16.968
...you and Syed are close; its ok;

1841
01:54:17.500 --> 01:54:20.012
...but respected brother
had just one issue with this...

1842
01:54:21.000 --> 01:54:23.512
...look its my duty to tell you...

1843
01:54:25.125 --> 01:54:31.847
...he felt in fact he was sure,
that Syed... he too has constipation..

1844
01:54:43.917 --> 01:54:44.893
Syed..

1845
01:54:46.667 --> 01:54:47.342
You want a drink?

1846
01:54:47.542 --> 01:54:48.768
Do you have constipation?

1847
01:54:49.417 --> 01:54:50.143
Huh?

1848
01:54:50.375 --> 01:54:52.102
Do you have constipation...?

1849
01:54:53.417 --> 01:54:53.967
<i>Ya“</i>

1850
01:54:54.167 --> 01:54:55.300
Why didn't you tell me before...

1851
01:54:55.500 --> 01:55:00.970
I mean..its not
chronic..just..Piku...

1852
01:55:09.000 --> 01:55:12.968
here... is the balance amount...
and this is for petrol

1853
01:55:13.417 --> 01:55:16.600
And what about that
outing on Ganga ghat..

1854
01:55:17.167 --> 01:55:18.675
...and that mental torture that I
went through because of your dad..

1855
01:55:18.875 --> 01:55:20.477
...where is the money for all that?

1856
01:55:21.667 --> 01:55:25.010
My god yaar...he kept
everyone on their toes...

1857
01:55:27.542 --> 01:55:30.842
You can’t judge parents
no...no matter how they are...

1858
01:55:31.042 --> 01:55:35.010
After taking care
of that kind of a man..

1859
01:55:36.292 --> 01:55:39.092
...even you've come in the category
of Rani Laxmi Bai... Annie Besant...

1860
01:55:39.292 --> 01:55:44.353
...kinds...you know...
the great women...

1861
01:55:45.417 --> 01:55:49.886
anybody in my place
would've done that

1862
01:55:52.000 --> 01:55:53.602
No one does it these days

1863
01:55:56.792 --> 01:55:58.394
So now...?

1864
01:56:01.250 --> 01:56:03.353
...will you manage it alone...?

1865
01:56:08.542 --> 01:56:10.269
I think so..

1866
01:56:11.917 --> 01:56:17.137
I mean..that much
dad has prepared me..

1867
01:56:23.542 --> 01:56:25.519
...it's a small spelling..

1868
01:56:26.750 --> 01:56:31.094
...BHASKOR..BHASKOR..KOR..not KAR...

1869
01:56:31.750 --> 01:56:34.478
...if it's not done by tomorrow,
I am not going to pay..

1870
01:56:35.792 --> 01:56:37.098
KOR!

1871
01:56:45.875 --> 01:56:51.015
Sister.. I...

1872
01:56:58.667 --> 01:56:59.973
OK come from tomorrow...

1873
01:57:00.833 --> 01:57:02.014
Ok.
